WEBVTT

00:02.100 --> 00:04.330
I have a little sister,

00:04.330 --> 00:07.460
whom I was separated from when
I was exiled from Neotopia.

00:11.110 --> 00:15.410
I just can't forget my brother's warmth.

00:24.320 --> 00:26.950
Noah, where are you?

00:29.460 --> 00:36.560
On behalf of Zymot,
I hereby declare war upon Neotopia!

00:49.640 --> 00:57.250
Far away from the town where I was born

00:57.250 --> 01:00.420
I am singing

01:00.420 --> 01:08.060
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

01:08.060 --> 01:11.330
Away in my pocket

01:11.330 --> 01:16.870
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:16.870 --> 01:21.910
Toward the unknown road

01:21.910 --> 01:27.350
I'll walk

01:27.350 --> 01:32.750
I'll move forward

01:32.750 --> 01:37.590
Not for someone else's sake

01:37.590 --> 01:43.060
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:43.060 --> 01:48.540
Just as the sun rises at dawn

01:48.540 --> 01:53.780
I pick out a melody with my voice

01:53.780 --> 01:57.800
Ephemerally yet strongly

01:59.450 --> 02:02.970
I live

02:08.520 --> 02:12.260
Episode 35
The Ones Who Are Sacrificed

02:12.260 --> 02:15.130
It's finally started!

02:15.130 --> 02:16.900
The war's begun!

02:16.900 --> 02:18.770
War?!

02:18.770 --> 02:20.600
Exactly.

02:20.600 --> 02:25.510
Neotopia is going to become a
territory of Zymot very soon.

02:25.510 --> 02:26.610
Ridiculous!

02:26.610 --> 02:30.080
This is my perfect opportunity to
take out both of you guys,

02:30.080 --> 02:32.550
but right now I need to hurry
and catch up with Hugh.

02:33.480 --> 02:38.940
My spirit collection will keep you company!

02:45.330 --> 02:46.950
Later!

02:48.130 --> 02:49.760
Stop!

02:50.670 --> 02:53.960
Damn, I need to return to the castle quickly.

02:54.640 --> 02:56.260
Sachura!

03:07.520 --> 03:09.140
Rambos!

03:40.280 --> 03:42.480
Why won't you call out Amir Gaul?

03:42.480 --> 03:45.110
Right now, I couldn't call him out even if I tried!

03:47.360 --> 03:49.150
Watch out!

03:50.730 --> 03:52.350
Noah!

04:02.070 --> 04:03.500
Are you okay, Noah?

04:03.500 --> 04:05.970
Yeah, more importantly,

04:05.970 --> 04:08.770
I need to hurry and get back to the castle!

04:10.510 --> 04:13.810
Noah, why did you save me?

04:16.750 --> 04:18.250
Kill any who resist.

04:18.250 --> 04:20.820
I don't care if they're women or children!

04:20.820 --> 04:22.950
Kill them all!

04:27.000 --> 04:31.170
Master Geh-Geh, this block has
been fully suppressed.

04:31.170 --> 04:34.970
Good, now move your squad on to the next one!

04:34.970 --> 04:36.600
Yes, sir!

04:44.880 --> 04:46.450
Holy Father Hyrum!

04:46.450 --> 04:47.980
The Zymot army and Tuskan beastmen

04:47.980 --> 04:50.850
have appeared in multiple places
on the outskirts of the capital!

04:50.850 --> 04:52.290
What did you say?!

04:52.290 --> 04:54.260
The enemy numbers in the thousands!

04:54.260 --> 04:57.630
We cannot calculate the total strength
of their military force!

04:57.630 --> 05:00.330
Battle has already broken out in several areas.

05:00.330 --> 05:03.000
Activate the emergency defense system!

05:03.000 --> 05:05.470
Do not allow the enemy to get
anywhere near the castle!

05:36.430 --> 05:38.070
Get out of my way!

05:38.070 --> 05:42.200
If you want to get by,
it will only be after you take me out.

05:43.710 --> 05:45.470
You guys go on ahead!

05:45.470 --> 05:46.470
Ma'am!

05:46.470 --> 05:48.100
Buvaris!

05:52.110 --> 05:53.740
Zakua!

06:07.160 --> 06:10.130
I must hurry to Holy Father Hyrum's aid!

06:21.280 --> 06:23.400
What a nice view...

06:44.730 --> 06:47.940
We will make this building the headquarters

06:47.940 --> 06:50.400
of our Zymot-Tusk allied forces!

07:00.780 --> 07:02.580
Die!

07:06.250 --> 07:08.090
Kira!

07:08.090 --> 07:09.720
Noah!

07:10.860 --> 07:12.660
Come on!

07:16.260 --> 07:17.890
Buvaris!

07:24.340 --> 07:26.740
Why you little...

07:26.740 --> 07:29.210
That boy again?!

07:30.710 --> 07:33.280
The marks on this map denote the five places

07:33.280 --> 07:35.820
we believe the enemy shifted in to.

07:35.820 --> 07:40.280
These areas have already fallen
under enemy control.

07:40.990 --> 07:46.530
Contact our ally, Templar, and request
military support immediately!

07:46.530 --> 07:49.600
The request has already been made.

07:49.600 --> 07:51.570
We have returned!

07:57.340 --> 07:58.970
Damn...

07:59.670 --> 08:00.740
This is it.

08:00.740 --> 08:03.710
Now is the time for me to put
that power to the test.

08:10.350 --> 08:13.050
You haven't assembled reinforcements yet?!

08:13.050 --> 08:16.920
My country has made repeated requests!

08:16.920 --> 08:19.720
You must assemble reinforcements
without delay!

08:20.530 --> 08:23.100
But we do not have enough information.

08:23.100 --> 08:25.900
If we cannot ascertain what the situation is there...

08:26.370 --> 08:30.000
Selecting troops also takes time.

08:30.000 --> 08:34.980
We will assemble troops as quickly
as we are able to.

08:34.980 --> 08:37.270
Please be patient a little longer.

08:38.480 --> 08:40.780
How they dawdle!

08:41.750 --> 08:44.850
What a dilemma this is...

08:44.850 --> 08:48.090
If Zymot and Tusk have joined forces,

08:48.090 --> 08:50.290
their power will be enormous.

08:50.290 --> 08:52.690
We cannot involve ourselves so readily.

08:52.690 --> 08:55.860
But Neotopia is our ally!

08:55.860 --> 08:58.200
We can't just turn our backs on them.

08:58.200 --> 09:01.400
It seems we should observe
the situation a bit longer

09:01.400 --> 09:03.700
before deciding on our course of action.

09:05.970 --> 09:09.110
Such crafty stalling...

09:09.110 --> 09:11.910
" Council of Sages, " my rear end!

09:13.480 --> 09:16.680
We should send in military support immediately.

09:16.680 --> 09:23.650
But there is concern that acting now
would result in even greater chaos.

09:25.130 --> 09:29.430
Is this the truth behind this country's façade
of philanthropy and harmony?

09:30.300 --> 09:32.270
Simply deplorable!

09:35.770 --> 09:39.170
Master Khan won't listen to me
when I try to talk to him,

09:39.170 --> 09:42.610
and he won't let me see Master Zico
either for some reason.

09:42.610 --> 09:45.580
I think Zed might have gotten into trouble again.

09:46.880 --> 09:50.690
He was taken away to Neotopia
and it's got me so worried!

09:50.690 --> 09:53.480
I don't know what to do anymore.

09:55.390 --> 09:58.060
Well, you're certainly in a pickle, aren't you?

09:58.060 --> 10:01.560
Shall we go to Neotopia then?

10:01.560 --> 10:03.690
Oh, Master Robès!

10:05.170 --> 10:08.070
Oh, I'll go, but I...

10:08.070 --> 10:09.870
Master Robès?

10:10.540 --> 10:16.280
Okay, here's to the conquering of Neotopia...

10:16.280 --> 10:18.880
Jeeves, bring us some wine.

10:18.880 --> 10:20.510
We're making a toast!

10:23.580 --> 10:27.540
Noah, I thought you said you had come to kill me!

10:49.810 --> 10:52.150
Helic, you bastard!

10:52.150 --> 10:56.450
Your selfish actions got the rest
of your team wiped out!

10:56.450 --> 10:58.690
Get a grip, damn it!

10:58.690 --> 11:01.620
You need to give it a rest with
this grudge of yours!

11:01.620 --> 11:06.290
There's not a single thing to gain by
lashing out at Neotopia now!

11:06.290 --> 11:11.000
So, are you saying you can forgive
Hyrum for what he's done?

11:11.000 --> 11:13.070
Of course not,

11:13.070 --> 11:17.440
but hatred will only beget more hatred.

11:17.440 --> 11:21.510
With the great technology we have here in Ulvarx,

11:21.510 --> 11:24.970
don't you think we need to take a higher road?

11:25.780 --> 11:27.550
You think you know it all.

11:27.550 --> 11:31.850
You can only say those things because
you're not from Neotopia!

11:33.890 --> 11:36.090
Doctor Vendar, please listen to me.

11:36.090 --> 11:40.050
Zymot and Tusk have joined forces
and invaded Neotopia!

11:40.700 --> 11:42.060
What did you say?

11:42.060 --> 11:46.000
This is a unique chance to bring down Hyrum!

11:46.000 --> 11:47.740
Is this true?

11:47.740 --> 11:48.800
Yes!

11:48.800 --> 11:50.300
I'm against it.

11:50.300 --> 11:52.270
I'm not interested in jumping on a bandwagon

11:52.270 --> 11:55.640
with the likes of Zymot and Tusk.

11:55.640 --> 11:58.610
If you're against it, then you don't have to help.

11:59.050 --> 12:03.480
Doctor Vendar, please give me Ex Machina!

12:03.480 --> 12:05.420
You can forget that.

12:05.420 --> 12:09.760
It is a composite of multiple spirit shards that
have been artificially fused together.

12:09.760 --> 12:12.290
A spirit that transcends all spirits,

12:12.290 --> 12:13.830
that is Ex Machina!

12:13.830 --> 12:15.300
If I had it,

12:15.300 --> 12:18.090
this time I would be able to
destroy Hyrum for sure!

12:19.130 --> 12:21.570
It is not completed yet.

12:21.570 --> 12:25.470
All of the experiments have
already been concluded!

12:25.470 --> 12:30.100
You're just afraid of the tremendous
power Ex Machina has!

12:33.450 --> 12:37.750
Helic, I agree with Ginga.

12:37.750 --> 12:41.220
Your hatred of Hyrum is too strong
for your own good.

12:41.220 --> 12:44.760
It will eventually lead you to your destruction.

12:44.760 --> 12:46.730
Doctor Vendar...

13:02.480 --> 13:07.050
The first defensive wall here is presently
our outermost line of defense.

13:07.050 --> 13:10.820
Fierce fighting continues in the populated
areas beyond the wall,

13:10.820 --> 13:13.690
and there has been a considerable
loss of civilian life.

13:13.690 --> 13:15.120
Is that so?

13:15.120 --> 13:18.530
We will split our remaining forces into two groups.

13:18.530 --> 13:23.700
The first will halt the enemy's advance here,
at the defensive wall's east gate.

13:23.700 --> 13:25.930
The other group will move to the front,

13:25.930 --> 13:29.390
reclaim the conquered areas
and clear out the enemy.

13:31.410 --> 13:34.110
How shall we organize our forces?

13:34.110 --> 13:38.050
Noah and Alec shall take care of
defense on the wall.

13:38.050 --> 13:40.710
Kira and Brian shall go to the front.

13:40.710 --> 13:41.850
Your Holiness!

13:41.850 --> 13:43.450
In the name of Absolute Law,

13:43.450 --> 13:47.390
we shall reclaim the city and wipe out the enemy,

13:47.390 --> 13:49.760
even if it costs us our lives!

13:49.760 --> 13:52.030
Good, I'm counting on you.

13:52.030 --> 13:55.460
Organize your forces and prepare
to move out immediately.

13:55.460 --> 13:57.090
Ma'am!

13:57.530 --> 13:58.700
Noah!

13:58.700 --> 14:00.370
Yes?

14:00.370 --> 14:02.740
I have something to tell you.

14:02.740 --> 14:04.530
Yes, Your Holiness.

14:10.740 --> 14:13.410
The power of my beastmen

14:13.410 --> 14:16.380
has put the outskirts of the city almost
entirely under our control.

14:17.150 --> 14:23.290
Our battle has been in preparation for
the revival of Great Tusker!

14:23.290 --> 14:25.930
We will unite our surplus forces

14:25.930 --> 14:29.230
and devote all our energy to the
search for the key spirits!

14:30.700 --> 14:31.800
That's a bunch of crap.

14:31.800 --> 14:33.430
What?!

14:34.500 --> 14:38.310
What I want is Hyrum's head,

14:38.310 --> 14:41.540
and all of this country's territory as well.

14:41.540 --> 14:43.840
How dare you insult King Gari?!

14:43.840 --> 14:45.640
I won't stand for it!

14:50.020 --> 14:53.820
I will take command of all forces henceforth.

14:54.490 --> 14:56.460
I trust there are no objections.

14:59.030 --> 15:05.630
Geh-Geh, slaughter all the Neotopians
who remain in the conquered areas.

15:05.630 --> 15:09.840
I will give you a squad of Zymotan troops
to complement your own squad.

15:09.840 --> 15:11.710
Y..Yes, sir.

15:11.710 --> 15:14.880
There's no need to spare the women and children.

15:14.880 --> 15:17.140
You will kill them all.

15:17.140 --> 15:18.380
Is that understood?

15:18.380 --> 15:20.010
Yes, sir!

15:23.180 --> 15:26.310
Just you wait, Hyrum.

15:33.530 --> 15:35.060
Noah...

15:35.060 --> 15:36.260
Yes?

15:36.260 --> 15:40.100
I can tell you this now with
the utmost confidence.

15:40.100 --> 15:44.060
You are Neotopia's savior.

15:45.270 --> 15:47.470
As long as you are here,

15:47.470 --> 15:51.600
this beautiful country will not fall to ruin.

15:56.350 --> 16:00.020
Stay by my side always from now on,

16:00.020 --> 16:03.060
and protect me,

16:03.060 --> 16:06.360
protect Absolute Law!

16:17.100 --> 16:20.240
You seem to be exhausted, Holy Father.

16:20.240 --> 16:24.140
This was supposed to have been
a day of celebration,

16:24.140 --> 16:27.920
honoring the tenth anniversary of your rule
and this country's founding.

16:27.920 --> 16:30.540
To think that it would turn out like this...

16:33.420 --> 16:35.660
My ideal!

16:35.660 --> 16:40.860
My ideal is a world that Absolute Justice
has brought complete order to!

16:40.860 --> 16:45.660
This world of my ideals has not yet been realized.

16:46.500 --> 16:49.800
I cannot die yet.

16:49.800 --> 16:51.710
If I am defeated here,

16:51.710 --> 16:54.880
then all the blood I've spilled...

16:54.880 --> 17:00.150
the scores who have died so that I
could realize my ideals...

17:00.150 --> 17:02.020
Their sacrifices will have been in vain!

17:02.020 --> 17:03.820
If things remain like this,

17:03.820 --> 17:07.620
I could not possibly face any of them!

17:08.990 --> 17:13.450
I, Diana, understand your feelings, Your Holiness!

17:15.630 --> 17:19.300
Nothing must happen to Noah!

17:19.300 --> 17:21.500
I don't care if the other squads are pared down.

17:21.500 --> 17:26.310
Give him twice the number of troops he has now!

17:26.310 --> 17:27.930
Understood!

17:35.720 --> 17:37.920
Is something wrong?

17:37.920 --> 17:42.420
All this about me being Neotopia's "savior"...

17:42.420 --> 17:46.050
Could I really have that kind of power?

17:48.000 --> 17:50.900
That is what Holy Father Hyrum said, isn't it?

17:50.900 --> 17:53.830
Then, you must believe.

17:53.830 --> 17:55.960
I also believe.

18:01.580 --> 18:04.280
You'll be going out to the front now.

18:04.280 --> 18:07.740
Take care of yourself,
for your brother's sake and everyone else.

18:10.050 --> 18:14.690
I just can't forget my brother's warmth.

18:14.690 --> 18:19.150
Even now my hands still remember
the warmth of his.

18:23.900 --> 18:28.000
Promise me that you'll come back alive,
without fail.

18:28.000 --> 18:31.310
All right, I promise.

18:31.310 --> 18:34.100
I will come back alive, without fail.

19:18.420 --> 19:20.890
Noah, where are you?

19:23.260 --> 19:27.220
Well, look at this, another one of them out here.

19:37.170 --> 19:40.800
Stop! She's still just a child!

19:41.180 --> 19:42.640
What was that?

19:42.640 --> 19:45.980
Master Geh-Geh gave us the order to kill them all.

19:45.980 --> 19:49.620
Killing such a young child

19:49.620 --> 19:52.390
is not something a beastman would do.

19:52.390 --> 19:55.590
Doing that would make us no
different than animals!

19:55.590 --> 19:57.460
Why you...

19:57.460 --> 19:59.930
Now you've gone too far!

20:04.300 --> 20:06.930
Don't you talk to me like that, buddy.

20:12.140 --> 20:13.940
Why, you!

20:28.060 --> 20:29.850
This is awful...

20:33.130 --> 20:35.100
There's nothing to be afraid of.

20:35.100 --> 20:37.560
See, I'm going to send you to a
better place right now.

20:45.640 --> 20:48.380
Who the hell are you?!

20:48.380 --> 20:50.380
Get out of here now while you've got the chance.

20:50.380 --> 20:52.170
O..Okay!

20:53.610 --> 20:57.320
What's the point in this?

20:57.320 --> 21:00.890
Do you enjoy killing totally innocent people?

21:00.890 --> 21:03.360
Do you get a kick out of it?!

21:09.730 --> 21:11.230
Thank you.

21:11.230 --> 21:12.970
You're okay, aren't you?

21:12.970 --> 21:14.930
Yeah, I'm fine.

21:15.440 --> 21:18.040
Oh! You're bleeding!

21:18.040 --> 21:21.110
Oh, shucks, that's nothing to worry about.

21:21.110 --> 21:25.070
Come on, I'll take you someplace safe.

21:26.550 --> 21:28.170
Yeah!

21:56.780 --> 21:59.750
Man, there's another one?

21:59.750 --> 22:01.280
What a pain.

22:01.280 --> 22:02.880
Well, let's just finish him off quick.

22:02.880 --> 22:04.850
Yeah, let's do it.

22:20.070 --> 22:21.870
I...

22:21.870 --> 22:25.500
I didn't come to this world to
get into battles like this.

22:26.840 --> 22:30.300
Noah, it must be the same for you.

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Even if we've been far apart

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Our hearts are still connected

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
And always will be, even to the end of time

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:09.680
My old days

23:09.680 --> 23:12.050
Living it up on the weekend as always

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Just simply having fun, innocently

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days, gone in the blink of an eye

23:19.760 --> 23:22.130
Since then, we've gone our separate ways

23:22.130 --> 23:24.030
Chasing our own goals

23:24.030 --> 23:25.030
We grow up

23:25.030 --> 23:26.700
Tuck our memories in our hearts, and wave

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Fix our eyes on where we're going

23:27.870 --> 23:29.870
Neither of us will give up

23:29.870 --> 23:31.510
Knowing the other's fighting just as hard

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
I don't mind if you're not near me

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
I want to see your smile, but it's not the time

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
The more I look back

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
The more I tell myself I'll show this to you one day

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
That will never change

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Even if we've been far apart

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Our hearts are still connected

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
And always will be, even to the end of time

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

24:17.420 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Wings Reborn

24:18.120 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Wings Reborn"
